00:00:37.953 --> 00:00:40.252
Up first is Arsenal which dubs itself

00:00:40.252 --> 00:00:42.829
as the intelligent camera assistant,

00:00:42.829 --> 00:00:45.912
and promises to "unlock the potential

00:00:46.928 --> 00:00:49.006
"of your DSLR or your mirrorless camera

00:00:49.006 --> 00:00:52.923
"and capture amazing
images in any conditions."

00:00:57.249 --> 00:01:00.941
- [Narrator] Let's talk about
taking the perfect photo.

00:01:00.941 --> 00:01:03.437
First, compose the shot,
check the histogram,

00:01:03.437 --> 00:01:06.293
adjust the exposure,
focus on your subject.

00:01:06.293 --> 00:01:08.952
Compute the hyperfocal distance
to keep everything sharp,

00:01:08.952 --> 00:01:11.297
enable bracketing to
get more dynamic range.

00:01:11.297 --> 00:01:14.165
Add a neutral density
filter, update the exposure,

00:01:14.165 --> 00:01:16.082
and then take the shot.

00:01:17.032 --> 00:01:18.865
We built a better way.

00:01:24.741 --> 00:01:26.715
- Today's DSLR mirrorless cameras

00:01:26.715 --> 00:01:28.631
have amazing optics and sensors,

00:01:28.631 --> 00:01:30.186
but they do very little to actually

00:01:30.186 --> 00:01:31.823
help you take a good photo.

00:01:31.823 --> 00:01:33.658
Finding the right settings involves

00:01:33.658 --> 00:01:36.827
a series of complex
techniques and formulas.

00:01:36.827 --> 00:01:39.823
As an engineer with a background
in artificial intelligence,

00:01:39.823 --> 00:01:43.306
I knew I could build a tool
to simplify the process.

00:01:43.306 --> 00:01:44.211
I wanted something that would

00:01:44.211 --> 00:01:45.767
let me focus on the composition,

00:01:45.767 --> 00:01:48.472
but would handle the details for me.

00:01:48.472 --> 00:01:51.015
So I created Arsenal, the world's first

00:01:51.015 --> 00:01:53.098
AI photography assistant.

00:01:55.062 --> 00:01:57.361
With one tap Arsenal finds settings

00:01:57.361 --> 00:01:59.694
to take the best photo possible.

00:01:59.694 --> 00:02:01.587
Arsenal's AI searches thousands of images

00:02:01.587 --> 00:02:05.689
in its database to suggest good settings.

00:02:05.689 --> 00:02:07.552
Next, it fine tunes the suggestions

00:02:07.552 --> 00:02:10.385
by analyzing 18 different factors.

00:02:12.811 --> 00:02:15.133
Arsenal uses state of
the art machine learning

00:02:15.133 --> 00:02:19.556
to help you take a great
photo in any condition.

00:02:19.556 --> 00:02:22.139
(upbeat music)

00:02:43.972 --> 00:02:45.864
Many of the memorable shots you see today

00:02:45.864 --> 00:02:48.813
are captured by combining
multiple exposures

00:02:48.813 --> 00:02:52.053
through a labor intensive
process called photo stacking.

00:02:52.053 --> 00:02:55.036
With Arsenal you can do this in seconds.

00:02:55.036 --> 00:02:56.708
Capture all the details in scenes

00:02:56.708 --> 00:03:00.875
with high dynamic range, get
everything in sharp focus,

00:03:04.736 --> 00:03:08.903
and create long exposures
without buying expensive filters.

00:03:10.939 --> 00:03:12.751
Using these advanced techniques,

00:03:12.751 --> 00:03:14.794
Arsenal will let you go
beyond the limitations

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:17.371
of your camera's sensor or lens.

00:03:17.371 --> 00:03:19.461
For times when you want complete control,

00:03:19.461 --> 00:03:22.247
you can wirelessly adjust manual settings,

00:03:22.247 --> 00:03:25.115
see a live preview,
and trigger the shutter

00:03:25.115 --> 00:03:27.646
all from up to 100 feet away.

00:03:27.646 --> 00:03:29.295
Arsenal also improves the experience

00:03:29.295 --> 00:03:31.245
of reviewing photos in the field.

00:03:31.245 --> 00:03:33.300
You can flip through the
photos on your camera,

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:36.203
zoom in to check out
details at full resolution,

00:03:36.203 --> 00:03:40.370
then share your favorite
photos right from your phone.

00:03:41.775 --> 00:03:43.668
And finally, Arsenal makes it easy

00:03:43.668 --> 00:03:46.335
to capture stunning time lapses.

00:03:49.287 --> 00:03:51.040
It automatically adjusts the exposure

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.259
and changing light, giving you

00:03:52.259 --> 00:03:54.430
a smooth day to night transition.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:55.940
You can even watch a high def preview

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:59.016
of your time lapse while it's being taken.

00:03:59.016 --> 00:04:00.862
Whether you're a pro
who has already mastered

00:04:00.862 --> 00:04:03.939
manual shooting, or you
just bought your first DSLR,

00:04:03.939 --> 00:04:05.855
Arsenal can help you take your photography

00:04:05.855 --> 00:04:07.329
to the next level.

00:04:07.329 --> 00:04:08.908
So before you replace your gear,

00:04:08.908 --> 00:04:12.019
try upgrading your technique with Arsenal.

00:04:12.019 --> 00:04:14.562
Arsenal is already being
tested in the field.

00:04:14.562 --> 00:04:17.302
Now I need your help
