00:04:51.273 --> 00:04:53.641
- [Narrator] Piloting drones
is a relatively new activity

00:04:53.641 --> 00:04:56.219
that most people are starting to explore.

00:04:56.219 --> 00:04:58.111
We wanted to design a
drone that introduced

00:04:58.111 --> 00:05:01.350
as many people as possible
to the First Person View

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:04.253
drone experience without
breaking the bank.

00:05:04.253 --> 00:05:07.039
Introducing a whole new flight experience.

00:05:07.039 --> 00:05:09.466
The Bolt is an innovative and versatile

00:05:09.466 --> 00:05:13.506
First Person View drone
available at a radical price.

00:05:13.506 --> 00:05:16.838
It's a complete, ready to
fly out of the box solution

00:05:16.838 --> 00:05:18.997
that's easy and safe to pilot.

00:05:18.997 --> 00:05:20.913
The drone for everyone.

00:05:20.913 --> 00:05:22.759
There are three ways to fly.

00:05:22.759 --> 00:05:25.186
First, for beginners, to start flying,

00:05:25.186 --> 00:05:28.541
simply turn on the drown
and turn on the controller.

00:05:28.541 --> 00:05:31.525
The two will sync up and
pair, and you can take off.

00:05:31.525 --> 00:05:33.777
The drone features altitude stabilization

00:05:33.777 --> 00:05:35.495
and a beginner's mode that makes

00:05:35.495 --> 00:05:37.701
picking up the basics a breeze.

00:05:37.701 --> 00:05:39.582
Learn how to safely and confidently

00:05:39.582 --> 00:05:41.950
maneuver and control your drone.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:44.702
Next, for those ready to
expand their horizons,

00:05:44.702 --> 00:05:46.536
attach the screen to the controller

00:05:46.536 --> 00:05:49.114
and start piloting the drone further away.

00:05:49.114 --> 00:05:51.645
Simply turn on the drone and the screen.

00:05:51.645 --> 00:05:53.816
The camera on the drone
will automatically sync

00:05:53.816 --> 00:05:57.252
and broadcast a live,
high definition feed.

00:05:57.252 --> 00:06:00.573
Mount the screen on the
controller and you're ready to go.

00:06:00.573 --> 00:06:01.838
Finally, for those ready for the full

00:06:01.838 --> 00:06:05.786
First Person View experience,
swap the screen to the goggles

00:06:05.786 --> 00:06:08.829
and prepare for a whole
new flight experience.

00:06:08.829 --> 00:06:11.569
Immerse yourself into the
world of FPV piloting,

00:06:11.569 --> 00:06:14.309
and cruise around high in the sky.

00:06:14.309 --> 00:06:16.805
Or try your hand at FPV drone racing

00:06:16.805 --> 00:06:18.616
and experience the incredible excitement

00:06:18.616 --> 00:06:20.706
from every twist and turn.

00:06:20.706 --> 00:06:22.784
Drone racing is a new and exciting sport

00:06:22.784 --> 00:06:25.629
that is quickly growing around the world.

00:06:25.629 --> 00:06:28.252
Using FPV goggles,
pilots race their drones

00:06:28.252 --> 00:06:31.283
around courses to compete
for the fastest times.

00:06:31.283 --> 00:06:34.023
It is truly the sport of the future.

00:06:34.023 --> 00:06:36.275
The Bolt can be used to
experience drone racing

00:06:36.275 --> 00:06:38.121
at a fraction of the current price.

00:06:38.121 --> 00:06:42.288
It's an exciting virtual
reality flying experience.

00:06:45.944 --> 00:06:49.150
The Bolt drone was designed
and tested in Los Angeles

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:51.229
by a team of expert product designers,

00:06:51.229 --> 00:06:54.178
aerospace engineers,
and drone enthusiasts.

00:06:54.178 --> 00:06:56.186
It's built on a carbon fiber frame

00:06:56.186 --> 00:06:59.460
that offers unmatched
performance and durability.

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:02.699
The HD camera provides crystal
clear video and photos.

00:07:02.699 --> 00:07:04.952
And the battery easily slides in and out

00:07:04.952 --> 00:07:06.252
for quick swapping.

00:07:06.252 --> 00:07:08.829
The drone design is modular
so that individual parts

00:07:08.829 --> 00:07:10.025
can be replaced.

00:07:10.025 --> 00:07:11.871
The result is a highly maneuverable

00:07:11.871 --> 00:07:14.181
and lightweight and aerodynamic drone.

00:07:14.181 --> 00:07:16.190
The bolt features a unique and innovative

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:19.557
FPV viewing system that
allows seamless transition

00:07:19.557 --> 00:07:21.438
from traditional viewing on the controller

00:07:21.438 --> 00:07:23.855
to FPV viewing using goggles.

00:07:25.478 --> 00:07:29.205
We're excited to offer the
Bolt drone at a radical price.

00:07:29.205 --> 00:07:31.202
Traditionally, consumers
purchase their drones

00:07:31.202 --> 00:07:33.175
