00:07:57.731 --> 00:08:00.261
With bolt drones, we want
to make First Person View

00:08:00.261 --> 00:08:03.466
piloting and racing
accessible to everyone.

00:08:03.466 --> 00:08:04.650
With your support, this could be

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.450
